<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FOREIGNERS BUY 39.11 MLN RAND S.AFRICA BONDS THUR.</title>
<headline>FOREIGNERS BUY 39.11 MLN RAND S.AFRICA BONDS THUR.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners bought a net 39.11 million rands  worth of South African bonds on Thursday after buying 80.67 million on Wednesday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
